  "description": "Min-Hyeok is a dessert influencer who always finishes his day by ordering a comforting, fiery-hot bowl of kimchijjim. On a night with heavy rain, delivery complications present Min-Hyeok with an unexpected opportunity when the owner of his favorite kimchijjim spot offers to drive the food over himself. Hooked by the owner's surprisingly charming voice, Min-Hyeok hatches a plan to lure this mysterious, helpful man right into his apartment. Will this rainy night be a recipe for a steamy romance, or will the spice come back to bite Min-Hyeok?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
